#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file keycapturewidget.ui line 27
#: rc.cpp:27 rc.cpp:97
msgid "Enter a special key or key combination to send to the remote side:"
msgstr "輸入要傳送至對方的特別鍵或按鍵組合:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file keycapturewidget.ui line 95
#: rc.cpp:31 rc.cpp:101
msgid ""
"This function allows you to send a key combination like Ctrl+Alt+Del to the "
"remote side. Press Esc to cancel."
msgstr "此功能容許你傳送如 Ctrl+Alt+Del 的按鍵組合至對方。按 Esc 取消。"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file maindialogbase.ui line 30
#: rc.cpp:34 rc.cpp:104
msgid "Remote &desktop:"
msgstr "遠端桌面(&D):"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file maindialogbase.ui line 49
#: rc.cpp:37 rc.cpp:107
msgid "Enter the hostname and display number"
msgstr "輸入主機名稱及顯示數字"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file maindialogbase.ui line 53
#: rc.cpp:40 rc.cpp:110
msgid ""
"Enter the name and display number of the computer that you want to connect "
"to, separated by a colon, e.g. 'mycomputer:1'. The address can be any valid "
"Internet address. The display numbers usually start at 0. If you do not have "
"a display number, try 0 or 1.\n"
"Remote Desktop Connection only supports systems that use VNC."
msgstr ""
"輸入要連接的電腦的名稱及顯示數字，以冒號分隔，例如『mycomputer:1』。讓位址可"
"以是任何有效的互聯網位址。顯示數字通常從 0 開始。如你沒有顯示數字，嘗試 0 或 "
"1 。\n"
"遠端桌面連線只支援使用 VNC 的系統。"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file maindialogbase.ui line 68
#: rc.cpp:44 rc.cpp:114
msgid "Turn on/off the network browsing panel."
msgstr "開關網絡瀏覽面板。"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file maindialogbase.ui line 83
#: rc.cpp:47 rc.cpp:117
msgid ""
"Enter the address of the computer to connect to, or browse the network and "
"select one. VNC and RDP compatible servers will be supported. <a href="
"\"whatsthisExampleUrls\"<h3>Examples</h3>"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file maindialogbase.ui line 113
#: rc.cpp:50 rc.cpp:120
msgid ""
"Rescans the network. Depending on the network configuration this may take a "
"few seconds until all systems have responded."
msgstr "重新掃描網絡。視乎你的網絡設定，這可花上幾秒鐘，直至所有系統回應。"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file maindialogbase.ui line 136
#: rc.cpp:53 rc.cpp:123
msgid "&Search:"
msgstr "搜尋(&S):"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file maindialogbase.ui line 149
#: rc.cpp:56 rc.cpp:126
msgid "Enter a search term"
msgstr "輸入搜尋項目"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file maindialogbase.ui line 152
#: rc.cpp:59 rc.cpp:129
msgid ""
"Enter a search term here if you want to search for a specific system, then "
"press Enter or click Rescan. All systems, whose description matches the "
"search term, will be displayed. The search is not case sensitive. If you "
"leave the field empty all systems will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"如要搜尋特定系統，在此輸入搜尋項目然後按「Enter」或單擊「重新掃描」。所有說明"
"符合搜尋項目的系統都會顯示出來。此搜尋不分辨大小寫。如留空此欄則會顯示所有系"
"統。"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file maindialogbase.ui line 183
#: rc.cpp:62 rc.cpp:132
msgid "Scop&e:"
msgstr "範圍(&E):"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file maindialogbase.ui line 210
#: rc.cpp:65 rc.cpp:135
msgid ""
"An administrator can configure the network to have several scopes. If this "
"is the case, you can select the scope to scan here."
msgstr "管理員可設定網絡有若干範圍。你可在此選擇要掃描的範圍。"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file maindialogbase.ui line 217
#: rc.cpp:68 rc.cpp:138
msgid ""
"Here you can see the systems on the network that allow you to connect. Note "
"that an administrator can hide systems, so the list is not always complete. "
"Click on an item to select it, double-click it to connect immediately."
msgstr ""
"你可在此看到網絡上容許你連接的系統。注意管理員可以隱藏系統，所以這未必是完整"
"的清單。單擊項目選取，雙擊則立即連接。"

